WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.890
Hi! English has 26 letters. Each letter has a name and a sound. Today we'll meet the letters and their sounds.

2
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.338
Every letter has a capital and a small form: A and a, B and b.

3
00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:21.690
Careful with b and d: b's tummy is on the right, d's is on the left.

4
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.658
The letters come in order. Sing the alphabet song to remember.

5
00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:32.298
A, e, i, o and u are vowels; the others are consonants.

6
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:35.058
B says b: ball, bus.

7
00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:38.154
M says m: mat, moon.

8
00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:41.658
S hisses like a snake: sun, sock.

9
00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:46.074
Short a says a: apple, ant.

10
00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:49.722
Watch out! It's ball, not dall!

11
00:00:49.872 --> 00:00:53.346
For b, draw a line, then the tummy on the right.

12
00:00:53.496 --> 00:00:58.458
Think of bed: b at the start, d at the end.

13
00:00:58.608 --> 00:01:07.458
Your turn! Which letter does sun start with, s or z? Pause and think.

14
00:01:07.608 --> 00:01:13.098
Sun starts with the hissing s. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:13.248 --> 00:01:21.906
Another one! What is the small letter for capital B? Pause and think.

16
00:01:22.056 --> 00:01:27.714
Small b has its tummy on the right. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:27.864 --> 00:01:35.970
Here's another! Which word starts with m? Pause and think.

18
00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:41.058
Moon starts with m. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:49.458
Try one more! Which letter comes after c? Pause and think.

20
00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:55.986
A, b, c, d: d comes after c. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:56.136 --> 00:02:03.738
Try one more! Is e a vowel? Pause and think.

22
00:02:03.888 --> 00:02:09.882
A, e, i, o, u are vowels, so yes. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:10.032 --> 00:02:18.234
Try one more! Which word starts with a? Pause and think.

24
00:02:18.384 --> 00:02:23.346
Ant starts with a. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:23.496 --> 00:02:31.866
Try one more! What is the capital letter for g? Pause and think.

26
00:02:32.016 --> 00:02:37.026
Capital g is G. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:37.176 --> 00:02:45.162
Last one! Which word starts with b? Pause and think.

28
00:02:45.312 --> 00:02:50.273
Bag starts with b. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:50.423 --> 00:02:58.266
Remember: each letter has a name and a sound. Match capitals and small letters, and don't mix up b and d.

30
00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:04.217
Find English names for things at home and say their first sound!

